---
import DefaultLayout from '../layouts/default.astro';
---

<DefaultLayout title="Privacy">
    <h1 id="privacy-notice">PRIVACY NOTICE</h1>
    <p><strong>Runeheart is in early testing.</strong></p>
    <p>
        Right now the game server does not keep accounts or progress. Your game settings and a
        cached copy of the map are stored only in your own browser, and you can clear them at any
        time by clearing this site's data.
    </p>
    <p>
        The game server receives what it needs to run the game while you play: your chosen name,
        your actions in the game and your chat messages. Connections pass through Cloudflare and
        Vercel, which host the game.
    </p>
    <p>This notice will be updated before accounts or saved progress are added.</p>
</DefaultLayout>
